# The bff image's build context is this repo's root. Without this file the
# whole tree — including a ~1400-package node_modules and the git history —
# is uploaded to the daemon on every build.
#
# Note the image installs dependencies itself from package.json + bun.lock
# (see docker/bff.Dockerfile), so excluding node_modules is required for
# correctness as well as speed: a host node_modules built for a different
# platform must never be copied in.
node_modules/
**/node_modules/
dist/
web/dist/
.git/
.ui-check/
*.log

# Secrets and local state — none of it belongs in an image layer.
config/users.json
config/secrets/
docker/secrets/
docker/.env
.env
.env.local
bff-data/
